WEBVTT

open-release-desk
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
Start with the release
workspace in a real browser.

prepare-release
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.230
The synthetic pointer moves
to each declared target.

enter-version
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.610
Camera zoom follows the
same target rectangle.

request-approval
00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.990
Submit the release for
a final human decision.

frame-human-review
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.470
PlainTake hands the visible
browser to a person.

approve-release
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.550
The person approves, and the
recorded scenario can continue.

show-approved-state
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.980
The final state is visible
and ready to verify.
